## Honor the domain LLM target in Ontology Assistant

Context: The Ontology Assistant received the saved endpoint name but discarded
its persisted target kind. It could therefore route an explicitly selected AI
Gateway model through name inference instead of the authoritative domain
configuration.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_ontology_assistant/engine.py
   Forward the domain endpoint kind to the shared LLM transport.
2. src/agents/agent_ontology_assistant/responses_agent.py
   Preserve the endpoint kind in streaming and fallback ResponsesAgent calls.
3. src/api/routers/internal/ontology.py
   Inject the saved domain endpoint kind into both Ontology Assistant APIs.
4. tests/units/agents/test_agent_ontology_assistant_engine.py
   Add regression coverage for forwarding an AI Gateway target.
5. tests/units/api/test_routes.py
   Verify the ResponsesAgent request receives the authoritative saved kind.

